{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_001","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":".. DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE!!!\n.. Generated automatically from Godot engine sources.\n.. Generator: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/doc/tools/make_rst.py.\n.. XML source: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/doc/classes/PackedScene.xml.","location_hint":"paragraph 2","char_start":19,"char_end":279,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_002","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"**Inherits:** :ref:`Resource<class_Resource>` **<** :ref:`RefCounted<class_RefCounted>` **<** :ref:`Object<class_Object>`","location_hint":"paragraph 5","char_start":330,"char_end":451,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_003","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"An abstraction of a serialized scene.","location_hint":"paragraph 6","char_start":453,"char_end":490,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_004","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":".. rst-class:: classref-introduction-group","location_hint":"paragraph 7","char_start":492,"char_end":534,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_005","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"A simplified interface to a scene file. Provides access to operations and checks that can be performed on the scene resource itself.","location_hint":"paragraph 9","char_start":561,"char_end":693,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_006","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"Can be used to save a node to a file. When saving, the node as well as all the nodes it owns get saved (see :ref:`Node.owner<class_Node_property_owner>` property).","location_hint":"paragraph 10","char_start":695,"char_end":858,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_007","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"\\ **Note:** The node doesn't need to own itself.","location_hint":"paragraph 11","char_start":860,"char_end":908,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_008","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"\\ **Example:** Load a saved scene:","location_hint":"paragraph 12","char_start":910,"char_end":944,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_009","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"# Use load() instead of preload() if the path isn't known at compile-time.\n var scene = preload(\"res://scene.tscn\").instantiate()\n # Add the node as a child of the node the script is attached to.\n add_child(scene)","location_hint":"paragraph 15","char_start":983,"char_end":1196,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_010","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"// C# has no preload, so you have to always use ResourceLoader.Load<PackedScene>().\n var scene = ResourceLoader.Load<PackedScene>(\"res://scene.tscn\").Instantiate();\n // Add the node as a child of the node the script is attached to.\n AddChild(scene);","location_hint":"paragraph 17","char_start":1222,"char_end":1471,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_011","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"\\ **Example:** Save a node with different owners. The following example creates 3 objects: :ref:`Node2D<class_Node2D>` (``node``), :ref:`RigidBody2D<class_RigidBody2D>` (``body``) and :ref:`CollisionObject2D<class_CollisionObject2D>` (``collision``). ``collision`` is a child of ``body`` which is a child of ``node``. Only ``body`` is owned by ``node`` and :ref:`pack()<class_PackedScene_method_pack>` will therefore only save those two nodes, but not ``collision``.","location_hint":"paragraph 18","char_start":1473,"char_end":1939,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_012","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"# Create the objects.\n var node = Node2D.new()\n var body = RigidBody2D.new()\n var collision = CollisionShape2D.new()","location_hint":"paragraph 21","char_start":1978,"char_end":2094,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_013","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"# Create the object hierarchy.\n body.add_child(collision)\n node.add_child(body)","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":2097,"char_end":2176,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_014","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"# Change owner of `body`, but not of `collision`.\n body.owner = node\n var scene = PackedScene.new()","location_hint":"paragraph 23","char_start":2179,"char_end":2278,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_015","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"# Only `node` and `body` are now packed.\n var result = scene.pack(node)\n if result == OK:\n var error = ResourceSaver.save(scene, \"res://path/name.tscn\") # Or \"user://...\"\n if error != OK:\n push_error(\"An error occurred while saving the scene to disk.\")","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":2281,"char_end":2533,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_016","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"// Create the objects.\n var node = new Node2D();\n var body = new RigidBody2D();\n var collision = new CollisionShape2D();","location_hint":"paragraph 26","char_start":2559,"char_end":2679,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_017","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"// Create the object hierarchy.\n body.AddChild(collision);\n node.AddChild(body);","location_hint":"paragraph 27","char_start":2682,"char_end":2762,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_018","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"// Change owner of `body`, but not of `collision`.\n body.Owner = node;\n var scene = new PackedScene();","location_hint":"paragraph 28","char_start":2765,"char_end":2867,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_bc58f284031b_019","source_id":"src_bc58f284031b","source_hash":"d1f295cfbe5ffc62b9f4fbe2e3924f94256157f09fd467b2ef74a3837788c6ae","text":"// Only `node` and `body` are now packed.\n Error result = scene.Pack(node);\n if (result == Error.Ok)\n {\n Error error = ResourceSaver.Save(scene, \"res://path/name.tscn\"); // Or \"user://...\"\n if (error != Error.Ok)\n {\n GD.PushError(\"An error occurred while saving the scene to disk.\");\n }\n }","location_hint":"paragraph 29","char_start":2870,"char_end":3159,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:54:40.116Z"}
